      <Author>Sergey Solomentsev</Author>
      <Version>1.1.0.0</Version>
      <Revision />
      <License>Apache License 2.0</License>
      <Comment>Color Picker field type for the Sitecore Content Editor and Experience Editor. Supports Sitecore XP 10.1+.</Comment>
      <Attributes />
      <Readme>Adds the "Color Picker" field type, the Palette template with two sample palettes, and the swatch and color distance validators.

Items are delivered as item resource files (.dat), so the Sitecore application restarts after installation.

To uninstall, open /sitecore/admin/ColorPicker/Uninstall.aspx as an administrator.

Documentation: https://github.com/sergatgh/sitecore-color-picker</Readme>
      <Publisher>Soft Consulting US LLC</Publisher>
      <PostStep />
      <PackageID>SoftConsulting.ColorPicker</PackageID>
    </metadata>
  </Metadata>
